WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.020
Hi, this is

2
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:12.500
Michelle. So I will be presenting my final
software prototype,

3
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:17.800
which is AmaiReady. So Amai is a Shona
word for mother, but it also sounds

4
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.420
like MI. And that's very intentional
because AmaiReady is a maternal delivery

5
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:29.500
preparation and support system designed
for pregnant women living in rural

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.680
communities in Zimbabwe. So what exactly
is the problem?

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.260
Many pregnant women struggle to prepare
all the supplies that they need for

8
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:45.400
delivery. Some are asked to source
maternity kit items themselves.

9
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:52.460
This includes gloves, cotton wool,
maternity pads, and additionally,

10
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:57.320
access to clinics may also be affected by
distance, cost, and limited information.

11
00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:02.120
So mothers may not know what items are
still missing, which clinic is the nearest

12
00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.920
to them, or where to request for help.

13
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.280
So why exactly is this a problem?

14
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.400
Missing supplies delay delivery
preparation.

15
00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.640
So this means that mothers would only
discover missing items close to their

16
00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:20.900
delivery date. Information is often then
scattered between clinic visits, paper

17
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.700
records, sometimes even verbal
instructions.

18
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.580
And support administrators may also
struggle to track requests consistently.

19
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:36.440
So this then creates stress during a
period that is already vulnerable for

20
00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:41.540
pregnant women. So this is the problem
that AmaiReady aims to solve.

21
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:46.180
So AmaiReady brings the main preparation
tasks into one system.

22
00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.880
This is where now you will see a mother
can register, log in, and create her

23
00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:55.080
pregnancy profile, make requests, and so
forth.

24
00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:59.520
And on the other hand, the administrator
can log in securely, review the support

25
00:01:59.520 --> 00:01:59.880
requests.
